Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:03:00.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快醒來吧 母后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.49,0:03:03.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是詛咒 尼迪娜的詛咒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:05.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:06.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要慌
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:11.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡吧 直到世界末日為止
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.18,0:03:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詛咒瑪雅娜國
