Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.72,0:04:03.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.42,0:04:04.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.23,0:04:09.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是白雪公主嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.21,0:04:10.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼事嗎 老奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:12.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個蘋果送給妳吃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.93,0:04:14.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是魔法蘋果
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.81,0:04:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要吃了它 什麼願望都會實現
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.39,0:04:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝妳
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:22.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的願望只有一個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.57,0:04:25.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是希望跟王子殿下過幸福的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.16,0:04:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 快吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:38.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡吧 直到世界末日為止
