Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.92,0:05:27.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 白雪公主她...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.14,0:05:33.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我心愛的白雪公主啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有點太過頭了...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:39.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多麼美麗的容顏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.66,0:05:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多麼白皙的玉手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.40,0:05:46.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你演樹的話為什麼來阻礙我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.58,0:05:50.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為劇本裡根本就沒有握手的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.55,0:05:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是王子就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 胖虎演王子就...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:05:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猜拳決定的 你有意見嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.40,0:06:01.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過王子應該像我這樣有風度的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.41,0:06:03.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是說我沒風度嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.85,0:06:05.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夠了 你們住手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.75,0:06:08.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣子根本無法練習了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.12,0:06:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.91,0:06:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難得我拿『萬能舞台裝置』給你們製造氣氛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.27,0:06:15.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,練習中止
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:20.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們總是這麼快就出問題
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:22.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.53,0:06:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣會趕不上學藝會的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.48,0:06:29.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本來我就對演《白雪公主》沒什麼興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:33.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 我覺得是很感人的故事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.17,0:06:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子 公主 巫婆 真的存在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.05,0:06:41.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 畢竟《白雪公主》只是個童話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.18,0:06:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 我是時候去補習了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.93,0:06:45.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉我先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.67,0:06:47.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.02,0:06:49.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我也要回去店裡幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.29,0:06:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎也要嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 這個借我用一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.82,0:06:54.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.44,0:06:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼關係嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.61,0:07:04.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 一時手滑按了老鼠軍團的按鍵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.45,0:07:05.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.87,0:07:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:09.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 振作點
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:12.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鼠 老 鼠...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.46,0:07:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他到底想用來做什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:21.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿它用來做演唱會的練習是最好不過的道具了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:26.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超級巨星的舞台是... 這個 這個
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.31,0:07:30.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,觀眾有... 十萬人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.37,0:07:31.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:56.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開唱了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.90,0:08:04.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣 今天的服裝可是新的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.70,0:08:10.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我要盡情唱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 被拿走了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.83,0:08:22.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 去要回來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.78,0:08:25.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『物件交換布』
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.62,0:08:28.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是可以將東西跟東西交換的布
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.21,0:08:30.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你有什麼不要的東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.63,0:08:33.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要的東西... 有一袋垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.48,0:08:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用『交換布』包住 然後大喊要交換的東西就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:40.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.97,0:08:41.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.81,0:08:43.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.01,0:08:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交換
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:45.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你喊太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是胖虎 是孩子王
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.81,0:08:54.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快想辦法啊 哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:09:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}哆啦A夢～
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.68,0:10:21.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 我正沉浸在演唱會歡樂著的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.42,0:10:23.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼想聽的話 來我家就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.92,0:10:27.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是有十萬人觀眾的演唱會啊 我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.50,0:10:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是用『萬能舞台裝置』開演唱會啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.05,0:10:34.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是絕對不會還回來的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.07,0:10:36.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用其他的方法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.25,0:10:40.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『時空洞』 跟 『時空取物器』
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.55,0:10:42.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,選好時間地點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.16,0:10:44.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後用『時空取物器』取回來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.84,0:10:47.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就選今晚的胖虎家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:56.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.77,0:10:59.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡得很熟呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.38,0:11:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在枕頭旁邊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.54,0:11:03.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再靠近一點嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.71,0:11:04.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我試試
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK 讓我來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:11.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:12.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.22,0:11:17.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還差一點點
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.71,0:11:19.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:20.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:24.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬆不開啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.09,0:11:26.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.57,0:11:28.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.81,0:11:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 這是你搞的鬼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.60,0:11:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆 哆啦A...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.03,0:11:34.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住 我不會放過你的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:39.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點 大雄 『時空洞』...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.88,0:11:49.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香 妳沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.24,0:11:51.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.36,0:11:55.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太胡鬧了 所以『時空洞』的時空混亂了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.18,0:11:59.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這到底是怎麼一回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.86,0:12:02.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.39,0:12:04.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼 不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:05.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼再聯絡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.40,0:12:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.31,0:12:09.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.46,0:12:10.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:18.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:21.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,髒兮兮的 什麼沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.77,0:12:23.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去給我洗乾淨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.73,0:13:12.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洗完舒服多了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.28,0:13:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得快點...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:18.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這到底是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.85,0:13:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有小偷進來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.54,0:13:21.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.94,0:13:28.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.75,0:13:32.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:37.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什麼 貓嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.67,0:13:38.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心點
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.63,0:13:41.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.98,0:13:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我的測驗卷 還給我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.82,0:13:51.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.88,0:13:54.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 好像連接到什麼地方...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.43,0:13:56.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 來一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.56,0:13:57.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.15,0:14:02.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 這是哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:06.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.85,0:14:08.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好茂密的叢林
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.28,0:14:24.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點回去比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.65,0:14:27.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我要拿回零分測驗卷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.07,0:14:31.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.27,0:14:35.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我們不要走太遠比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你逃不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:41.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還給我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.53,0:14:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.99,0:14:50.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還差一點就能拿回來的說
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.03,0:14:52.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是放棄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:54.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.39,0:14:57.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.97,0:15:03.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.55,0:15:05.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.08,0:15:07.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.82,0:15:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.30,0:15:14.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.14,0:15:17.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.21,0:15:19.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.84,0:15:22.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都說了等等嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.69,0:15:27.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快點過來這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:30.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像跟我們言語不通
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.37,0:15:33.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『翻譯蒟蒻』
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.15,0:15:36.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快點
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請等等 我們並不是什麼可疑人物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.58,0:15:47.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.51,0:15:52.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來無法溝通了 快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.17,0:15:53.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.45,0:15:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然有這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:05.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:09.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟大雄好像
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟 你是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:15.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定是尼迪娜用妖術變出來的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.76,0:16:18.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不認識什麼尼迪娜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:20.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現出你的真面目吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:21.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.24,0:16:23.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『魔術棒』
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.86,0:16:28.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又用什麼妖術了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.71,0:16:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.19,0:16:34.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.37,0:16:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:38.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 事情越來越複雜了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.33,0:17:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.31,0:17:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 掉到沼澤去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.03,0:17:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:13.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.37,0:17:21.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:22.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:27.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傷腦筋 這樣更分不出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.61,0:17:41.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好癢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.79,0:17:44.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要這樣子 快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.27,0:17:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都說住手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.75,0:17:52.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我 放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.27,0:17:57.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 幫幫我 幫幫我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:00.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那是什麼樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.58,0:18:04.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要笑 快幫忙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.15,0:18:05.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:09.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 我在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.83,0:18:18.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想不到我們像得 連波波露都弄錯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.09,0:18:22.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我也給弄糊塗了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.14,0:18:25.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來你們跟尼迪娜沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.81,0:18:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你終於明白了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.18,0:18:31.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不重要  這裡到底是哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.88,0:18:35.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是太陽王國 瑪雅娜國
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.73,0:18:48.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是這個國家的王子 迪奧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.19,0:18:50.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.03,0:18:53.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 瑪雅娜國是在哪兒的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:58.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來是『時空洞』超越了時代 跟某個地方連接了起來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.06,0:19:02.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是我的寵物 波波露
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.29,0:19:05.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,壞習慣是喜歡亂收集東西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.32,0:19:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的測驗卷在哪兒 還給我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.11,0:19:10.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.78,0:19:12.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們才是 從哪兒來的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.85,0:19:14.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,報上名來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.00,0:19:16.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:19.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比大雄 來自日本
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.36,0:19:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本？  從沒聽過
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.83,0:19:23.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在北方還是南方的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.11,0:19:26.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個...怎麼說明才好呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.62,0:19:29.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 從這個洞穴來的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼説 日本就在這個洞咯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.30,0:19:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以說了 怎麼說明才好呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:37.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,與其說明 讓他看更好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.94,0:19:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,進去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.10,0:19:46.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這究竟是...難以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.83,0:19:48.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我們快回去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.47,0:19:50.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等一下去 落了東西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.88,0:19:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 你放在去哪兒了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.87,0:20:03.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 總是「波波」叫的讓人頭痛的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.11,0:20:04.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是王子殿下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.90,0:20:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.28,0:20:19.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 還真收集了不少破爛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.26,0:20:22.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的零分試卷 還有漫畫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.94,0:20:28.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我重要的東西 要還給我哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.99,0:20:31.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好 不可以再做這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.86,0:20:33.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是王子殿下的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:34.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.59,0:20:36.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.66,0:20:39.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,確實是在這邊的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.31,0:20:41.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都已經再三囑咐要你們好好看護王子的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.73,0:20:44.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,實在很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.42,0:20:46.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之 先在這附近找找
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.94,0:20:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果王子有什麼意外就不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.46,0:20:55.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.54,0:20:57.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然在這種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.83,0:21:03.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 是時候回王宮了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.33,0:21:06.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是王子 我是野比大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.93,0:21:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.03,0:21:11.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 請戴上瑪雅娜的面具
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.98,0:21:14.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們將我跟迪奧弄錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.15,0:21:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧就是王子殿下您的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.70,0:21:17.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.07,0:21:25.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.08,0:21:27.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『哆啦夢』是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.80,0:21:36.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.36,0:21:48.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樹裡面居然有這樣的房間
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:50.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是用什麼魔法變出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.44,0:21:52.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都說了這不是魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:54.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.37,0:21:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這叫做漫畫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.30,0:21:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本的文字嗎 寫著些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.77,0:21:59.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.62,0:22:04.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡萩 叭叭叭叭叭 糟糕 哇 多多多多
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.82,0:22:06.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.37,0:22:10.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 不過大雄可真慢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.14,0:22:12.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.32,0:22:14.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.27,0:22:18.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 弄的滿地泥沙 被媽媽看到的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.65,0:22:21.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要擅自走動啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:25.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囉嗦 不准對王子下命令
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.56,0:22:32.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牆壁嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.87,0:22:44.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨魔術世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.60,0:22:47.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 你一定是魔法師尼迪娜的手下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.88,0:22:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先小試牛刀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.80,0:22:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放馬過來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.20,0:22:53.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快從箱子裡面出來跟我一決勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.65,0:23:02.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就嚇到的話還早著呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.84,0:23:05.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡的妖術師
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.07,0:23:07.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 給我出來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.46,0:23:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃得真快
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.07,0:23:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好媽媽不在家
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.90,0:23:19.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.09,0:23:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄的媽媽 這個家裡最可怕的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:27.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是誰 得罪王子的人都不可饒恕
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.38,0:23:31.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之 先洗乾淨身上的泥沙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.97,0:23:33.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普通的淋浴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.80,0:23:35.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:37.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之先洗乾淨
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.42,0:23:39.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瀑 瀑布...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.56,0:23:43.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『衣物瞬間乾燥機』
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.63,0:23:44.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起風了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.41,0:23:46.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就會乾的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.69,0:23:49.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 這個國家全是魔法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.34,0:23:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 我餓了 拿點食物給我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.59,0:23:57.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是任性
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.74,0:23:58.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.34,0:24:00.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.36,0:24:03.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想吃什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.07,0:24:08.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好冷 這股寒氣是什麼 快關上
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.57,0:24:12.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼吃杯麵好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.88,0:24:15.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先等我燒開水
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.15,0:24:18.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噴火了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.93,0:24:23.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這 這是什麼 居然在森林的裡面
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.42,0:24:26.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子 迪奧大人 回朝
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.15,0:24:58.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當王子真威風啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.61,0:25:05.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 已經回到王宮了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.05,0:25:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡就是迪奧家嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.18,0:25:13.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家根本沒法比
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.10,0:25:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼 辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.27,0:25:17.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.56,0:25:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 替您更衣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.89,0:25:24.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下怎麼弄得這麼髒
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.99,0:25:27.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 我自己洗就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.65,0:25:29.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.09,0:25:31.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饒了我吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.54,0:25:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當王子原來有這麼多人伺候 真有點過意不去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.36,0:25:42.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是威風凜凜
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.91,0:25:51.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼多好吃的 真的可以吃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.66,0:25:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不客氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.64,0:25:59.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃 當王子的生活太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.48,0:26:02.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼好吃的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.34,0:26:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是第一次吃到
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.16,0:26:07.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真會做菜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.15,0:26:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還好媽媽不在家...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.79,0:26:11.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.28,0:26:12.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽回來了...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.98,0:26:15.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 哆啦A夢 你們在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.56,0:26:17.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.12,0:26:19.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 媽媽 我要跟她決鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.91,0:26:23.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 還是暫時先回到叢林裡去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.13,0:26:30.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃得好飽 王子的生活很適合我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.64,0:26:34.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.73,0:26:37.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 你居然知道我在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.97,0:26:40.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露告訴我們的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.78,0:26:43.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.87,0:26:47.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被看到有兩個王子就糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.82,0:26:49.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.70,0:26:51.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼我要藏起來
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.78,0:26:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼事要差遣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.50,0:26:58.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事 退下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.93,0:27:05.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厲害 大雄還真有王子的模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.26,0:27:06.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我請安
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.55,0:27:08.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你又這麼得意忘形...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.53,0:27:13.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有事拜託你們 跟我交換身份
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.59,0:27:16.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我當王子？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.76,0:27:21.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對 我當你 想去瞭解一下日本
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.07,0:27:24.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且要找尋打倒尼迪娜的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.12,0:27:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒尼迪娜？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.75,0:27:42.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜曾經是瑪雅娜國的神官長
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.64,0:27:46.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是後來開始使用旁門左道的妖術 迷惑民心
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.92,0:27:48.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后將她驅逐了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.75,0:27:53.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以尼迪娜將迪奧的媽媽詛咒以至長眠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.09,0:27:56.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意言詞 你們不可直呼我名字  要叫王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.71,0:27:59.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.43,0:28:02.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被驅逐出國家的尼迪娜
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.37,0:28:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在在沒人敢接近的白骨森林深處的黑暗神殿裡
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.08,0:28:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在身體日漸衰弱的母后身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.75,0:28:22.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾向太陽之神起過誓
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.80,0:28:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要打倒尼迪娜 幫母后解除詛咒
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.75,0:28:30.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了這個 我要變得更強
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.77,0:28:34.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說 只是短時間內交換應該沒關係吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.02,0:28:36.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行不行 我已經覺得夠煩了...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.54,0:28:38.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是為了幫助人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.98,0:28:40.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.78,0:28:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 就這麼決定
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.79,0:28:45.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天開始交換 行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.76,0:28:55.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.45,0:28:59.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼幫助人 其實是你自己想換而已吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.48,0:29:02.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被媽媽發現的話該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.20,0:29:04.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經發現了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.05,0:29:05.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.45,0:29:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄得這麼亂 快給我收拾乾淨
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.98,0:29:19.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼你們交換衣服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.28,0:29:21.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄戴上假髮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.88,0:29:25.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子戴上帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.04,0:29:28.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還要戴上沒有度數的眼鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.65,0:29:31.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 這樣就沒問題了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.68,0:29:34.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰都不會發現
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.18,0:29:35.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很像我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.84,0:29:37.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不好看 不過沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.78,0:29:41.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安全起見 給你『備用百寶袋』帶在身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.82,0:29:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別太勉強
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.93,0:29:45.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.98,0:29:57.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡真大啊 很容易迷路的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.47,0:30:00.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.81,0:30:06.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,免禮 免禮 大家辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.73,0:30:08.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心情真舒暢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.59,0:30:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那裡在做什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.29,0:30:26.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.81,0:30:35.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 要更加積極地接近對手
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.94,0:30:38.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.88,0:30:41.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是叫我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.17,0:30:44.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正好想去接你
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.86,0:30:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧 開始練習
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.38,0:30:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 來吧 哪個方向過來都行
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.59,0:30:55.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,選你擅長的的攻擊方式吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.41,0:30:57.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.66,0:30:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.53,0:31:01.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.93,0:31:06.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.49,0:31:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有破綻
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.05,0:31:11.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.57,0:31:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子一定是訓練不足
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.29,0:31:18.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 麻煩妳照顧王子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.06,0:31:19.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 父親
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.59,0:31:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 繼續練習
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.85,0:31:27.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託你不要太擅自亂動
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.04,0:31:29.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難得我們收拾乾淨的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.38,0:31:31.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.29,0:31:34.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.01,0:31:35.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香妳好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.78,0:31:37.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,午安
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.11,0:31:40.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 這本書從圖書館借來的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.46,0:31:42.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以用來做戲劇的參考
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.22,0:31:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼書 給我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.21,0:31:47.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一點用處也沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.37,0:31:51.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女人太礙事了 回去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.34,0:31:56.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你太過分了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.89,0:31:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香 其實他是...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.60,0:31:59.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.57,0:32:00.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.00,0:32:05.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼做 別人當然會氣跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.23,0:32:06.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這跟我無關
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.93,0:32:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在要出去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.66,0:32:10.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隨你的便
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.58,0:32:21.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.54,0:32:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是可怕的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.58,0:32:30.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能大意
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.57,0:32:33.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道是...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.99,0:32:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真危險
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.59,0:32:45.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 飛上天了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.07,0:32:46.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要亂動
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.91,0:32:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比 你...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.95,0:32:57.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老師 很抱歉 這是有很複雜的原因的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.73,0:32:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上幫你收拾好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.94,0:33:07.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您醒過來了啊 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.48,0:33:09.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妳是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.74,0:33:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下不要開玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.66,0:33:14.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是谷谷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.39,0:33:17.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妳叫谷谷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.08,0:33:20.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 難道是被爸爸打到的關係...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.37,0:33:24.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 沒事 我很精神
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.34,0:33:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.66,0:33:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.43,0:33:33.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經打磨好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.53,0:33:35.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.42,0:33:37.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望王子殿下能戴上它
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.66,0:33:39.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.42,0:33:41.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝妳
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.60,0:33:45.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎樣 合適嗎 我會好好珍惜的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.15,0:33:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.43,0:33:53.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒 只是覺得王子殿下跟平時不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.47,0:33:58.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下這麼高興 還是第一次見到
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.33,0:34:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得很幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.04,0:34:04.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這個收到這條項鏈 所以特別高興
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.42,0:34:07.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 我想出去散步 幫我帶路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.76,0:34:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下說要自己一個人出去真少有
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.11,0:34:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.10,0:34:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過《白雪公主》裡面的王子就是一個人出去的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.60,0:34:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得那是好事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.65,0:34:29.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,輪到我了 去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.25,0:34:34.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些小孩子在做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.59,0:34:38.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用繩子玩占卜 王子不是也玩過的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.20,0:34:41.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛 真不走運
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.78,0:34:43.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是第一名
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.30,0:34:45.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有趣的樣子 讓我也加入吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.63,0:34:53.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 怎麼了 為什麼要逃啊 回來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.21,0:34:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家為什麼要逃走呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.75,0:35:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為突然見到王子的關係
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.06,0:35:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知不覺地玩起翻花繩了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.13,0:35:09.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮 形狀好像蝴蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.38,0:35:11.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 那麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.33,0:35:15.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是魚對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.36,0:35:16.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掃帚
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.64,0:35:18.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 這次是...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.36,0:35:20.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,橋
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.82,0:35:23.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 這是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.31,0:35:24.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.79,0:35:26.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是花 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.24,0:35:29.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.73,0:35:34.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 這個什.......麼
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.99,0:35:35.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樹
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.81,0:35:37.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對 是槍
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.68,0:35:40.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜  是東京鐵塔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.39,0:35:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東京鐵塔？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.99,0:35:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東京鐵塔是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.43,0:35:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 對啊 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.15,0:35:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 是怎麼做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.40,0:35:51.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想學 可以教我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.26,0:35:52.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.76,0:35:55.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊 那就教你們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.99,0:35:59.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個怪物的真面目是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.34,0:36:03.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是怪物 是叫車的交通工具
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.41,0:36:06.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請你不要一個人出去好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.34,0:36:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要對我下命令
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.09,0:36:09.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.33,0:36:13.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.14,0:36:14.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.68,0:36:15.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.93,0:36:18.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然叫我「這傢伙」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.77,0:36:22.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 說去什麼學藝會練習
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.87,0:36:24.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實是跑去玩
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.10,0:36:27.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我 無禮的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.91,0:36:33.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是在玩 我可是肩負重大的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.65,0:36:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要說夢話
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.47,0:36:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去給我除草
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.56,0:36:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是王子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.83,0:36:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是王子的話 媽媽就是女王
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.26,0:36:46.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去除草
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.14,0:36:47.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.19,0:36:48.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早就說過了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.23,0:36:56.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 玉米
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.34,0:36:58.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的有點像了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.84,0:37:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天再不下雨的話就慘了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.30,0:37:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是尼迪娜的詛咒嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.70,0:37:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王陛下也是因為她 直到現在還長眠著
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.20,0:37:09.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天知道會怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.94,0:37:13.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜是 那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.36,0:37:17.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都怕她 一切都是因為她的詛咒
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.32,0:37:20.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不下雨 並不是因為什麼詛咒
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.43,0:37:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那為什麼還要舉行活祭品儀式
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.08,0:37:26.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活祭品
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.73,0:37:54.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神聖之泉塞納迪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.34,0:37:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在獻上我們的活祭品
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.50,0:37:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請解除尼迪娜的詛咒
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.90,0:38:01.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓上天賜予我們雨水吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.76,0:38:07.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妳去吧 永遠伺候在神的旁邊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.34,0:38:10.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.88,0:38:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.87,0:38:13.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.88,0:38:16.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 您這是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.87,0:38:20.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕對不允許進行活祭品儀式
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.17,0:38:24.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您說什麼 王子殿下不是也已經同意了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.53,0:38:27.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說不行就是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.57,0:38:30.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能不理會等待雨水的民衆
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.42,0:38:32.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妳快點去
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.28,0:38:35.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 只要下雨就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.40,0:38:40.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『氣象盒』
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.67,0:38:43.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還好帶著『備用百寶袋』來
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.51,0:38:46.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放入『雨雲卡』
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.10,0:38:49.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.51,0:38:57.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是奇跡 不用獻上活祭品也能下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.09,0:38:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.71,0:39:02.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 到底是怎樣做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.86,0:39:05.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之 這樣儀式可以終止了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.81,0:39:26.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子什麼時候擁有如此的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.63,0:39:31.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,時日臨近 我們報仇的日子快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.61,0:39:34.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們也差不多該出場了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.05,0:39:43.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了 你很少這麼勤奮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.32,0:39:46.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有生以來 還是第一次除草
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.87,0:39:49.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝點東西吧 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.31,0:39:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個真可口
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.26,0:39:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幫助人後喝的東西是不是特別清爽可口
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.25,0:39:59.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.69,0:40:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 大雄 說我是母后...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.25,0:40:15.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼王子殿下 明天也交換吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.58,0:40:19.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我學到不少了 哆啦夢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.12,0:40:23.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫哆啦A夢 給我記好名字
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.19,0:40:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 還那麼任性
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.27,0:40:27.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一輩子做王子也無所謂哦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.68,0:40:29.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.81,0:40:34.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那裡有個叫谷谷 像靜香般溫柔的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.09,0:40:36.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.06,0:40:37.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.67,0:40:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 沒什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.83,0:40:42.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真期待明天
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.15,0:40:55.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.18,0:40:56.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.58,0:40:58.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我 谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.33,0:40:59.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.39,0:41:01.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的王子殿下真威風啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.93,0:41:04.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我也不同意活祭品儀式的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.46,0:41:07.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來就是想說這個的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.29,0:41:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒其他事了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.00,0:41:10.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.27,0:41:14.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很忙 退下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.46,0:41:15.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.22,0:41:38.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我認輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.23,0:41:40.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫加 太沒用了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.09,0:41:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡奧 過來
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.97,0:41:46.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,認輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.60,0:41:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真沒用 算了 回家睡覺去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.83,0:41:52.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝殿下指導
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.39,0:41:59.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 去看看母后吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.14,0:42:03.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼晚突然被叫出來
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.95,0:42:06.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子也太任性了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.82,0:42:10.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是也不能違抗他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.19,0:42:14.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶爾輸給他 讓他高興是最好的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.34,0:42:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子保護得了這個國家嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.00,0:42:25.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后 請告訴我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.45,0:42:26.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎樣才能變強
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.69,0:42:32.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎樣才能做個像父王那樣稱職的瑪雅娜國國王—『太陽王』
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.77,0:42:37.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后 我還不夠成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.10,0:42:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.82,0:42:58.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接著 今天做什麼好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.53,0:43:00.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.05,0:43:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.83,0:43:03.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我伊沙姆
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.51,0:43:05.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是來接您去接受棒術練習的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.69,0:43:16.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站在這種地方很危險的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.49,0:43:18.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.15,0:43:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 太胡鬧了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.70,0:43:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了吧 哆啦夢 是我贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.89,0:43:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.43,0:43:27.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.67,0:43:29.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最壞的事情發生了...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.75,0:43:33.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前的晚上你那強力膠可把我給害慘了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.67,0:43:36.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我是來還給你的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.44,0:43:37.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 其實...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.85,0:43:38.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無禮的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.89,0:43:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這下子...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.60,0:43:44.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有種就跟我去空地
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.42,0:43:45.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求之不得
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.76,0:43:51.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在才開始決勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.29,0:43:52.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.21,0:43:52.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.89,0:43:54.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦 怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.59,0:44:01.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.58,0:44:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.59,0:44:11.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我認輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.10,0:44:13.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎麼了 昨天也是...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.71,0:44:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一點也不像平時的王子
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.38,0:44:19.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請站起來 直到你恢復平時的身手
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.97,0:44:21.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天要好好練習
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.94,0:44:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.72,0:44:32.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的大雄太過棘手了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.03,0:44:36.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不賴嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.06,0:44:37.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 勝負...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.28,0:44:42.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們到此為止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.88,0:44:42.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.91,0:44:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到誰先死為止
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.59,0:44:46.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.99,0:44:48.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.85,0:44:52.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.50,0:44:57.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最討厭這樣的大雄了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.53,0:45:03.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.22,0:45:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實這個大雄 並不是真正的大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.68,0:45:14.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.37,0:45:15.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.72,0:45:17.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.27,0:45:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受不了棒術練習
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.40,0:45:23.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你果然不是大雄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.12,0:45:27.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的分不出來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.48,0:45:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼說 這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.13,0:45:33.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 這位是王子殿下咯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.07,0:45:35.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}遇到了各種各樣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.37,0:45:36.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}有些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.17,0:45:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.90,0:45:37.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}然後呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.71,0:45:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}嗯 果然...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.51,0:45:35.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難怪這麼強
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.78,0:45:37.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不賴
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.95,0:45:40.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夠資格做瑪雅娜國的戰士
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.15,0:45:41.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.41,0:45:43.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有座很宏偉的金字塔
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.79,0:45:47.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有很多珍貴的動物 就好像...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.13,0:45:48.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,童話世界
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.55,0:45:49.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.53,0:45:52.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 也帶我們去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.52,0:45:53.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.73,0:45:57.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 拜託了 帶我們去瑪雅娜國吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.24,0:45:59.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我招待大家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.78,0:46:03.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 決定好了 出發去瑪雅娜國
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.31,0:46:09.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 這樣子不行 要換好瑪雅娜國的服裝
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.86,0:46:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『換衣服照相機』
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.63,0:46:25.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡就是瑪雅娜國嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.77,0:46:27.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是叢林而已啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.63,0:46:29.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王宮在這前面
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.09,0:46:31.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好美麗的綠色
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.68,0:46:34.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不好呢 居然要這樣子...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.51,0:46:37.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為被看到有兩位王子就糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.51,0:46:38.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.21,0:46:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很適合你啊 雄子
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.56,0:46:43.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託 不要這樣子啦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.47,0:46:44.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.20,0:46:57.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 這裡就是王子的寢室嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.36,0:46:58.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.81,0:47:00.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部是用石頭做的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.86,0:47:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面更宏偉哦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.27,0:47:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 是我谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.74,0:47:10.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用怕 他們是日本國來的我的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.81,0:47:13.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個 我爸爸在找您
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.12,0:47:16.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.13,0:47:19.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼妳帶大家去參觀瑪雅娜國吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.45,0:47:22.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我叫谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.59,0:47:24.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.07,0:47:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.80,0:47:28.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶叫 不 我叫雄子
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.36,0:47:29.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.71,0:47:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.20,0:47:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 谷谷 拜託妳了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.60,0:47:34.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.46,0:47:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犀利
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.90,0:47:39.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然看過遺跡的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.15,0:47:41.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,實物原來是這麼漂亮的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.71,0:47:43.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能來太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.24,0:47:44.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.86,0:47:51.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是市集
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.41,0:47:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真熱鬧呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.62,0:47:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.43,0:48:04.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真少有啊 居然跟王子殿下以外的人親近
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.12,0:48:07.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我是容易跟動物友好的類型...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.94,0:48:17.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是鬥技場
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.40,0:48:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪雅娜國的男性 從小就要接受棒術練習
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.53,0:48:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.77,0:48:25.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想試試看
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.79,0:48:29.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 找到王子殿下了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.28,0:48:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 父親
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.58,0:48:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下跟這些客人在房裡
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.58,0:48:34.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.02,0:48:38.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好 都過了練習時間了 王子殿下卻...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.11,0:48:41.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大叔 請教我棒術
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.28,0:48:43.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.03,0:48:46.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是日本國來的王子殿下的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.53,0:48:48.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.05,0:48:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 好吧 我就教你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.45,0:48:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.01,0:48:55.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.05,0:48:56.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心 放心
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.98,0:48:59.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸是瑪雅娜國的棒術教練
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.92,0:49:01.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.43,0:49:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.82,0:49:11.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最後 白雪公主跟王子終於能在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.08,0:49:13.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,過著幸福快樂的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.21,0:49:16.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎樣 是不是很感人的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.07,0:49:17.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 很感人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.92,0:49:20.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧王子是怎樣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.84,0:49:23.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然有點不容易親近
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.84,0:49:26.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近卻變得很溫柔
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.69,0:49:31.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 還教會了我玩翻花繩
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.12,0:49:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你不能跟谷谷說交換身份的事
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.29,0:49:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鱷魚 鱷魚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.19,0:49:45.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.36,0:49:46.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.34,0:49:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這條河沒有鱷魚的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.40,0:49:52.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我確實看到的 很大的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.14,0:49:55.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你的倒影吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.16,0:49:57.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 的確是看到了啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.06,0:50:04.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.78,0:50:14.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 表演翻花繩給我們看看好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.18,0:50:16.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你表演一下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.14,0:50:18.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放肆 走開
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.40,0:50:20.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們以為王子殿下是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.37,0:50:21.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走開
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.44,0:50:31.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 就這樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.39,0:50:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 記住剛剛的呼吸方法
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.29,0:50:37.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 伊沙姆老師 再一次好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.32,0:50:38.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.88,0:50:41.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡奧 那傢伙真行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.42,0:50:44.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然第一次接觸 卻學得很快
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.53,0:50:47.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厲害 說不定連任性王子都不是他的對手呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.27,0:50:51.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡奧 莫加
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.39,0:50:53.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.02,0:50:56.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們去球技場準備沙加地
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.07,0:50:58.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙加地
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.19,0:50:59.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.10,0:51:02.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下要進行沙加地
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.94,0:51:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.56,0:51:08.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下要進行沙加地
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.11,0:51:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷小姐 不好了 王子殿下要進行沙加地
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.83,0:51:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.63,0:51:18.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙加地是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.09,0:51:20.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪雅娜國流傳下來的球技
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.99,0:51:27.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方法是使用腳控球射入對方龍門
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.46,0:51:30.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最先取得三分就算勝利
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.57,0:51:33.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟足球一樣嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.16,0:51:35.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那為什麼這麼緊張
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.08,0:51:55.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這場比賽 是必須以性命做賭注的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.95,0:52:01.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敗者要聽憑對方的任何要求
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.82,0:52:04.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使是被對方奪取性命
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.17,0:52:06.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.09,0:52:08.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下只有一個人而已
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.06,0:52:09.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣怎麼比
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.11,0:52:16.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好了 認真地來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.36,0:52:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.00,0:52:19.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,認真可以嗎 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.08,0:52:52.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,進了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.95,0:52:55.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太過分了 剛剛犯規啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.12,0:52:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手沒碰到球就不算的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.51,0:52:59.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然有這種規則
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.03,0:53:01.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 這次一定要...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.77,0:53:17.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贏定了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.24,0:53:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去 王子殿下的性命...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.60,0:53:22.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一個人對兩個人太勉強了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.42,0:53:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.90,0:53:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.64,0:53:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶 不 我來幫王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.58,0:53:35.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.40,0:53:40.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要你幫忙 回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.49,0:53:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 雖然我來幫忙可能幫不了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.23,0:53:50.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我不認為一加一會小於一
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.55,0:53:54.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為 你並非孤單一人的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.48,0:53:57.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.14,0:53:59.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們這邊用兩個人繼續比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.35,0:54:02.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多一個人又怎樣 只不過是女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.53,0:54:06.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們上 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.92,0:54:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.23,0:54:14.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.45,0:54:24.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我 放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.83,0:54:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做的好 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.63,0:54:33.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.73,0:54:34.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.57,0:54:35.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.34,0:54:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,進了 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.02,0:54:49.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,球呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.81,0:55:02.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,進了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.16,0:55:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同分了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.54,0:55:05.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 只差一分而已
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.11,0:55:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,輸了就糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.11,0:55:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.62,0:55:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.89,0:55:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做的好 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.48,0:55:33.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.41,0:55:40.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.28,0:55:42.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.15,0:55:43.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.42,0:55:47.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我們贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.02,0:55:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.66,0:55:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 請對他們進行處分
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.65,0:56:01.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 就交給你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.98,0:56:03.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隨你怎麼處置
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.89,0:56:05.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交給我？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.57,0:56:06.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.66,0:56:08.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 饒了他們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.93,0:56:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 饒了他們？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.69,0:56:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 大家都很努力 玩得很開心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.54,0:56:16.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.71,0:56:18.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是說了隨我處置的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.69,0:56:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 饒了他們
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.12,0:56:23.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.54,0:56:26.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡奧 莫加 這次就放過你們
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.55,0:56:29.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感謝聖恩
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.85,0:56:34.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.43,0:56:36.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄那傢伙真有氣度啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.43,0:56:38.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.69,0:56:39.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.17,0:56:52.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后 雖然那幫人有點奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.47,0:56:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他們是我的得力夥伴
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.67,0:56:57.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.53,0:56:58.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.53,0:57:00.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.75,0:57:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 東京鐵塔
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.58,0:57:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼 真無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.63,0:57:11.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最討厭這樣的大雄了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.44,0:57:15.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.64,0:57:40.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.26,0:58:02.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.35,0:58:10.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.57,0:58:16.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個是...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.47,0:58:17.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.07,0:58:25.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子 谷谷被我帶走了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.72,0:58:27.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個聲音是 尼迪娜
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.32,0:58:30.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要用她做食之儀式的祭品
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.41,0:58:32.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妳說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.14,0:58:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想救她的話就自己一個人來黑暗神殿
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.55,0:58:40.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,記得是自己一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.63,0:58:51.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.15,0:58:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我卡奧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.81,0:58:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我莫加也在
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.20,0:58:55.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛剛的話都聽到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.15,0:58:58.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 真的太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.07,0:59:01.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好 這事千萬不能對其他人說
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.14,0:59:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會照尼迪娜說的自己一個人去救谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.50,0:59:07.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不准對其他人說 這是命令
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.78,0:59:09.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.27,0:59:19.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.55,0:59:23.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們到底去了哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.02,0:59:24.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊沙姆師傅
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.58,0:59:26.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.73,0:59:28.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.03,0:59:29.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是說了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.06,0:59:30.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.38,0:59:32.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.13,0:59:35.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下呢 去了哪兒呢 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.43,0:59:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}好 加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.41,0:59:36.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.81,0:59:37.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.97,0:59:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.14,0:59:40.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.67,0:59:41.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您平安無事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.86,0:59:45.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了 忘了戴假髮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.05,0:59:47.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經救了谷谷大人了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.18,0:59:50.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷她怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.72,0:59:53.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚被尼迪娜掠走了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.27,0:59:56.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底發生了什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.73,0:59:59.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實 我是...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.48,1:00:01.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.64,1:00:03.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是真正的王子
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.23,1:00:05.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼說谷谷跟...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.07,1:00:06.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.29,1:00:08.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去了黑暗神殿
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.69,1:00:10.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太魯莽了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.24,1:00:12.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊沙姆師傅
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.25,1:00:14.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.41,1:00:15.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.35,1:00:18.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜說要王子一個人去...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.61,1:00:21.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們什麼也沒聽到 再見
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.88,1:00:30.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,錯不了 王子殿下去救谷谷了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.92,1:00:33.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下的槍跟頭盔都不見了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.97,1:00:49.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在就去追王子
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.33,1:00:51.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,師傅 我們也來幫忙
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.96,1:00:55.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖說幫忙 但尼迪娜是可怕的魔法使啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.79,1:00:56.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又怎樣
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.95,1:01:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們這邊可有22世紀科學的結晶 哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.87,1:01:03.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不太可靠
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.76,1:01:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真失禮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.10,1:01:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊沙姆先生 黑暗神殿的方向是？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.48,1:01:10.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這邊的北方
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.41,1:01:13.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 用『竹蜻蜓』去追王子殿下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.88,1:01:14.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.53,1:01:18.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這之前 幫忙換一下這裝扮吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.18,1:01:20.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當雄子不是挺好的嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.31,1:01:20.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.98,1:01:23.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK 來了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.77,1:01:25.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.18,1:01:27.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼 王子殿下？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.88,1:01:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是看起來像而已
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.53,1:01:34.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是谷谷做的項鏈
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.45,1:01:37.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.94,1:01:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也要一起去救谷谷啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.10,1:01:43.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你們
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.38,1:01:45.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 出發了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.25,1:01:53.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這真是粗暴的魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.11,1:02:16.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白骨森林
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.98,1:02:37.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 雷電把電池打出問題了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.68,1:02:39.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快降落
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.39,1:02:53.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.77,1:02:56.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人嗎 救命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.04,1:03:00.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.96,1:03:08.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.05,1:03:10.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.64,1:03:11.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.00,1:03:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 撐著點
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.61,1:03:25.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.65,1:03:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要來
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.16,1:03:31.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼 當然是為了幫王子跟谷谷啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.31,1:03:33.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這跟你們沒關係
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.38,1:03:36.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會沒關係 我們是朋友啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.78,1:03:39.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也許我們跟王子的身份地位不同
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.73,1:03:42.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我覺得一加一肯定大於一
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.47,1:03:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們來幫忙不是理所當然的嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.93,1:03:47.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.07,1:03:49.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄說的對
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.13,1:03:51.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然了 朋友怎能見死不救呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.74,1:03:52.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧 小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.75,1:03:55.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然了 大雄 說的好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.84,1:03:59.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 已經沒人能幫我們了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.62,1:04:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 大家
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.30,1:04:04.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧 不對 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.04,1:04:06.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫迪奧就行了 我們是朋友嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.32,1:04:07.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.14,1:04:10.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來你們站一起還真難區分誰是誰呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.21,1:04:11.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.62,1:04:15.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 走吧 迪奧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.09,1:04:23.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打聽過了這座山谷有個湖
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.16,1:04:25.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,湖的對岸就是黑暗神殿
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.89,1:04:28.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個山谷真是幽深啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.88,1:04:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看不到谷底呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.87,1:04:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉下去就糟糕了 大家小心點
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.96,1:04:40.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到盡頭了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.77,1:04:44.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 『竹蜻蜓』
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.62,1:04:48.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能 剛剛雷把電池打到出問題了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.11,1:04:49.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這懸崖
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.92,1:04:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別廢話了 大家爬上去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.98,1:05:00.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走開 走開
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.48,1:05:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.95,1:05:09.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 沒完沒了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.29,1:05:11.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走開 走開
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.18,1:05:15.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 快想辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.09,1:05:19.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法 能飛到哪就是哪吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.66,1:05:21.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神啊 保佑我們 還差一點了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.98,1:05:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧 不要緊吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.20,1:05:25.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.42,1:05:26.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,師傅
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.68,1:05:27.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.59,1:05:28.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.68,1:05:30.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕上了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.18,1:05:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是神奇的法術
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.93,1:05:36.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,師傅 還差一點而已 一點而已
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.45,1:05:38.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.08,1:05:39.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是驚險啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.82,1:05:46.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,師傅
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.74,1:05:48.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 危險
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.38,1:05:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得去救他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.71,1:05:50.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能的 住手
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.99,1:05:53.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 師傅他...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.67,1:05:55.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要哭哭涕涕的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.65,1:05:58.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊沙姆不是會在這種地方死掉的男人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.45,1:05:59.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要相信他
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.10,1:06:04.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它們追來了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.43,1:06:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 快逃
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.14,1:06:07.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 快點
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.32,1:06:09.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,師傅 你一定...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.72,1:06:12.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定會得救的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.77,1:06:21.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我累壞了 跑不動了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.47,1:06:24.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該不會追到這裡了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.32,1:06:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那裡
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.56,1:06:30.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那座就是黑暗神殿
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.79,1:06:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我們快去救回谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.10,1:06:44.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.35,1:06:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就天黑了 夜裡的森林是很危險的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.27,1:06:48.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 谷谷她...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.49,1:06:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜在明天正午之前都不會對谷谷怎麼樣的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.95,1:06:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.00,1:06:55.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為食之儀式是在明天正午
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.25,1:06:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼為了明天的戰鬥 今天就在這裡紮營
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.19,1:07:01.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 在這之前
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.78,1:07:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要小便
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.67,1:07:05.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 快點哦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.19,1:07:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真討厭
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.76,1:07:16.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都說了要一個人來
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.98,1:07:19.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卻帶了一堆多餘的人來
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.55,1:07:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本來是打算用妳做誘餌抓住王子的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.56,1:07:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要的只是王子而已
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.29,1:07:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對於膽敢阻礙明天食之儀式的傢伙 一律格殺勿論
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.00,1:07:38.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧也不是任性的王子嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.71,1:07:42.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可是想努力成為一個仁王啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.06,1:07:44.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當真正的王子也真不簡單呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.60,1:07:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你不是想當王子...的嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.08,1:07:57.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正午之前要去到黑暗神殿
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.29,1:07:58.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出發吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.46,1:08:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『萬能溜冰鞋』
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.28,1:08:05.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滑起來感覺怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.39,1:08:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.35,1:08:07.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.99,1:08:11.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點 迪奧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.31,1:08:15.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以了 讓我自己試試
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.79,1:08:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是迪奧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.15,1:08:18.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.22,1:08:19.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.83,1:08:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來也能在水上滑啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.53,1:08:31.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊 就這樣滑過湖吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.28,1:08:36.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像溜冰一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.06,1:08:48.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧滑得比大雄還好呢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.18,1:08:49.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.98,1:08:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.37,1:08:54.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快逃
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.56,1:09:01.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.46,1:09:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.73,1:09:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡可惡
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.24,1:09:15.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.23,1:09:21.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『風神扇子』
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.60,1:09:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧 迪奧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.14,1:09:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鱷...魚
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.51,1:09:41.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 王子？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.72,1:09:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆哆哆 哆啦A夢 快拿點什麼出來啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.75,1:09:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找我找我找我找
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.70,1:09:54.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『超級氣球口香糖』
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.88,1:09:55.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.47,1:10:04.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎 怎麼了 快停下
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.57,1:10:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我下去
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.59,1:10:11.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.67,1:10:12.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在不是高興的時候
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.92,1:10:14.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去追迪奧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.70,1:10:21.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.45,1:10:27.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.17,1:10:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到連瀑布也能滑
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.66,1:10:37.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這是萬能型的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.88,1:10:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.61,1:10:55.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 動物使者雅福被打敗了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.28,1:10:57.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那幫傢伙到底是何方神聖
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.73,1:11:00.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,食之儀式很快就要開始的說
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.63,1:11:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次由我看看情況
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.87,1:11:11.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.77,1:11:15.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕被帶到黑暗神殿去了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.07,1:11:16.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 我們得趕快...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.28,1:11:19.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.66,1:11:21.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到迪奧了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.03,1:11:22.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 等等
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.84,1:11:31.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.59,1:11:40.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快點啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.09,1:11:43.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然你這麼說 我已經不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.21,1:11:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會跟丟的 波波露
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.80,1:11:47.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我 沒力氣了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.95,1:11:48.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.68,1:11:50.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.27,1:11:51.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.69,1:11:58.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛 只是個石雕而已
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.58,1:12:01.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道哦 這在電視上看到過
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.99,1:12:03.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,記得是...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.25,1:12:04.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼 眼睛動了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.50,1:12:11.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於來了啊 王子
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.41,1:12:13.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石像說話了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.14,1:12:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我不是...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.73,1:12:16.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先不要說話
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.51,1:12:21.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個女孩正睡在神殿頂部的祭壇上
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.68,1:12:26.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就要對她實行黑暗魔術－食之儀式
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.60,1:12:29.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想救她的話就來神殿頂部吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.89,1:12:33.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個妖怪
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.98,1:12:39.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛 不過是塊岩石而已
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.28,1:12:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再磨蹭了 快去神殿
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.81,1:12:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,離正午已經沒多少時間了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.41,1:12:57.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這兒了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.14,1:12:59.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡就是黑暗神殿了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.05,1:13:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那裡的頂部
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.46,1:13:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.76,1:13:21.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子終於來了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.45,1:13:23.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子以外的全部抹殺
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.93,1:13:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 我馬上來救妳
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.31,1:13:51.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.85,1:14:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事也沒有
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.93,1:14:03.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.60,1:14:08.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿過去了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.77,1:14:11.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此 這只是幻象而已
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.71,1:14:12.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幻象？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.46,1:14:17.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有控制幻象的人
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.13,1:14:29.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好 王子 想救大家就自己一個人上來
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.19,1:14:48.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.13,1:14:52.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 沒事了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.40,1:15:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 你來救我了啊 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.57,1:15:04.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都平安嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.62,1:15:07.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的腳好像扭傷了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.32,1:15:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種程度沒關係
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.95,1:15:10.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.11,1:15:21.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太陽升得很高了 快要正午了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.22,1:15:23.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 我現在就去救妳
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.54,1:15:26.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 快想辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.66,1:15:30.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『空氣炮』
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.35,1:15:31.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.00,1:15:35.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.44,1:15:42.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 快捂住鼻子
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.84,1:15:45.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.48,1:15:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯人在那上面
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.29,1:15:51.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被識破了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.05,1:15:53.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是他用藥迷惑我們
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.06,1:15:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『遙控天線』 跟 『胡椒粉』
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.00,1:15:57.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次輪到我們了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.65,1:15:59.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 麻煩你控制了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.81,1:16:00.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.04,1:16:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.00,1:16:26.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 怎麼這麼沒用
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.67,1:16:28.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 快點
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.22,1:16:32.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我們走 小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.00,1:16:39.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.79,1:16:43.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於來了啊 王子
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.02,1:16:46.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷就在這裡 想救她的話就上來
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.78,1:16:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妳就是尼迪娜嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.83,1:16:50.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藍色狸貓 這裡沒你的事
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.94,1:16:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狸... 我不是什麼狸貓
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.40,1:16:54.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.16,1:16:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好燙 好燙 好燙
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.72,1:17:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 沒事吧 振作點
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.54,1:17:05.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒事
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.08,1:17:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 『百寶袋』燒沒了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.66,1:17:12.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜 為什麼要做這種事
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.68,1:17:14.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明知故問
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.28,1:17:18.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要用你做食之儀式的祭品
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.29,1:17:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用我做儀式的...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.40,1:17:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當黑暗女神吞噬太陽之時
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.50,1:17:27.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑暗吃掉太陽的時候？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.45,1:17:28.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是指日食
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.91,1:17:33.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到時候 我就能轉移到祭品的身上
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.49,1:17:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後 我就能得到永生
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.27,1:17:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妳是說妳要成為王子
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.25,1:17:42.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後支配瑪雅娜國嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.58,1:17:45.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是如此 真是聰明的小孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.51,1:17:47.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不會讓妳得逞
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.53,1:17:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休想妨礙我 歌德魯 幹掉他們
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.63,1:18:04.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.94,1:18:07.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子 上來
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.55,1:18:13.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 王子 怕了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.75,1:18:14.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他並不是...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.78,1:18:15.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要說話
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.86,1:18:23.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下定決心了嗎 這份勇氣值得誇獎
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.29,1:18:28.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,食之儀式的時刻來臨了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.31,1:18:32.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日食開始了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.80,1:18:39.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要趕上才行
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.62,1:18:44.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.85,1:18:52.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎你 王子
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.85,1:18:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點開始交換
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.69,1:19:02.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『物件交換布』
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.65,1:19:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.87,1:19:06.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你帶著『備用百寶袋』啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.39,1:19:07.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟石像交換
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.19,1:19:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什 什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.51,1:19:14.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不要做祭品
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.75,1:19:15.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想逃嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.59,1:19:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.50,1:19:17.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甘度
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.60,1:19:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我 放開我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.20,1:19:25.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.40,1:19:43.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有破綻
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.54,1:19:49.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.03,1:19:50.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得好 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.41,1:19:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊沙姆師傅
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.21,1:19:55.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你平安無事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.96,1:20:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,師傅
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.46,1:20:14.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厲害 不愧是我的師傅
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.81,1:20:18.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.69,1:20:20.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我老實點
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.91,1:20:23.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死到臨頭還不認命啊 王子
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.55,1:20:26.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.07,1:20:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.12,1:20:41.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪雅娜國的人們
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.44,1:20:45.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不許跟我作對 你們來了又能怎樣
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.34,1:20:48.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你們見識一下我尼迪娜的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.17,1:20:49.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.39,1:20:50.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.92,1:20:52.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.75,1:20:53.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.57,1:20:54.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.78,1:20:57.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.39,1:21:00.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.16,1:21:07.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才是王子
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.02,1:21:09.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兩個王子
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.98,1:21:10.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.33,1:21:17.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然有兩個王子
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.18,1:21:18.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.28,1:21:21.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪個 哪個才是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.57,1:21:25.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我遠方而來朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.33,1:21:26.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開妳的手
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.67,1:21:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要祭品的話 就用我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.12,1:21:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 請留步
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.47,1:21:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們需要王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.50,1:21:40.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰也不要過來
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.43,1:21:43.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對朋友棄之不顧 算什麼王子
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.77,1:21:49.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 因為你 我第一次有了真正的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.35,1:21:52.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對這些朋友 我不能見死不救
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.75,1:21:55.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.65,1:21:58.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是好人啊 我不能坐視不管
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.86,1:22:00.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.31,1:22:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是王子的決定
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.90,1:22:03.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.68,1:22:09.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.06,1:22:12.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開他
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.09,1:22:17.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪個都無所謂了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.39,1:22:24.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.75,1:22:25.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.42,1:22:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別阻礙我
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.04,1:22:30.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.94,1:22:34.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,認命吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.97,1:22:43.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.44,1:22:48.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有這個就什麼都不用怕了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.62,1:22:49.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧 快逃
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.87,1:22:53.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住 想無論如何都違抗我嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.24,1:23:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.55,1:23:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.29,1:23:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射門
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.11,1:23:48.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是尼迪娜的本來面目
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.51,1:23:53.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜打算去哪兒
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.26,1:24:03.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.18,1:24:04.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,師傅
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.53,1:24:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.14,1:24:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊沙姆師傅
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.17,1:24:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太遲了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.79,1:24:17.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.93,1:24:19.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.61,1:24:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神殿要塌了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.78,1:24:25.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.42,1:24:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.99,1:24:41.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.23,1:24:44.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 別管我 快走
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.27,1:24:45.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.32,1:24:47.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去我們都無法得救的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.52,1:24:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開手
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.60,1:24:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.60,1:24:56.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼甘度會...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.61,1:24:58.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救了我們
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.54,1:25:02.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我給它吃了『桃太郎牌馴服丸子』
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.43,1:25:03.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.24,1:25:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.41,1:25:10.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.59,1:25:13.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.59,1:25:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 求求妳 睜開眼睛吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.30,1:25:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來結局不能像童話故事那樣完美
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.19,1:25:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.02,1:25:40.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.66,1:25:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.99,1:25:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.93,1:25:50.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於醒來了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.19,1:25:51.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.88,1:25:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 妳沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.40,1:25:55.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.67,1:25:57.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有兩個王子...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.80,1:25:59.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.94,1:26:01.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 快想辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.93,1:26:04.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想她很快就會沒事的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.56,1:26:06.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起來嘛 谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.52,1:26:11.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.52,1:26:25.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后 看到您這麼精神真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.97,1:26:30.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧 你已經不再是王子了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.01,1:26:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要以太陽王的身份 好好統治這個王國
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.29,1:26:35.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.93,1:26:41.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太陽王 萬歲
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.98,1:26:52.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太陽王 萬歲
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.76,1:27:01.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 波波露 再見了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.68,1:27:04.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.42,1:27:05.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.86,1:27:10.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『時空洞』的時空出問題了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.08,1:27:12.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不快點的話就回不去了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.04,1:27:16.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是說 已經不能再來這裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.33,1:27:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能會那樣
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.66,1:27:20.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 幫我把這個還給迪奧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.65,1:27:23.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快點
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.88,1:27:30.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧 可能無法再見面了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.11,1:27:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我永遠不會忘記你的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.66,1:27:33.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了 迪奧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.97,1:27:35.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.96,1:27:56.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說 王子殿下的角色還是由我來當最合適
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.81,1:27:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是這樣 這次由我來當
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.71,1:28:01.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想當
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.26,1:28:02.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香也要嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.21,1:28:03.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是這樣太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.83,1:28:04.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.90,1:28:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 猜拳決定吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.87,1:28:08.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 就這樣就這樣
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.64,1:28:10.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們真好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.57,1:28:13.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猜拳就能當王子了
